Another example of KAP's optimization for an SMP system is that
in the doubly nested loop cases, such as subroutine FORCE (see
Figure 3), the KAP preprocessor automatically selects the outer
loop for parallel execution. In contrast, a vector machine such
as the CRAY-1 prefers the inner loop.

