Migration from DEC TUXEDO V2.1 to Novell's TUXEDO ETPS 5.0

Users of Digital's DEC TUXEDO V2.1 for DEC OSF/1 V2.0 are eligible for a
limited-time free upgrade to Novell's TUXEDO ETPS 5.0. This offer is valid
through April 15, 1995 and is contingent upon the user signing a letter
waiving Digital's obligation to provide continuing support for DEC TUXEDO
V2.1.

Migration to Novell's TUXEDO ETPS 5.0 is important for several reasons:

o  Users who do not upgrade to TUXEDO ETPS 5.0 will not be able to upgrade
