   Novell) 18 months from now. This includes phone support, software
   updates, and software fixes.

o  Digital's package for migrating existing TUXEDO software users to TUXEDO
   ETPS 5.0 is free of charge for the next three months. In addition,
   Digital engineering will provide technical support, as required, to
   complete the migration. After April 15, 1995, users who decide to migrate
   to 5.0 will need to purchase a new license at a significant cost. While
   migration does not have to be completed by April 15, users must commit to
   migration by this date to be eligible for the free delivery of TUXEDO
