o  The new TUXEDO ETPS 5.0 offers new features that should be attractive to
   users, including DCE, interoperability, domains, etc. Lock-in to the old
   DEC TUXEDO software will make access to new features impossible.

o  Migration should be extremely simple. It does not require any source code
   changes to the application; a simple recompile and link will do.

