CXI01 Asynchronous Multiplexer for DEC OSF/1 and Windows NT EISA/ISA Systems

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Provides direct connection of asynchronous lines for the AlphaServer 2100
   and 2000

o  Compliments terminal server approach for asynchronous connections

DESCRIPTION

The CXI01 Asynchronous Multiplexer products enable the asynchronous
connection of systems to terminals and other asynchronous devices. This
hardware is packaged with Windows NT and DEC OSF/1 device drivers by a
leading U.S. supplier of multiplexer products, Digiboard International.
Digital has tested the package extensively and is now reselling it without
removing the Digiboard name.

Two asynchronous multiplexers are available, the CXI01-AA and the CXI01-AD.
Both basic products support 16 ports. The CXI01-AA is expandable to 64
ports, and the CXI01-AD, which is capable of a higher throughput, is
expandable to 224 ports.

The CXI01-AB (Digiboard PORTS/16em) is used to add 16 additional
asynchronous ports to either the CXI01-AE (Digiboard EPCC/CON-16)
concentrator or the CXI01-AA (Digiboard PC/16em) product; cable is included.

The CXI01-AE (Digiboard C/CON-16) concentrator connects to the CXI01-AD host
adapter module and supports direct connection of 16 asynchronous lines. Each
CXI01-AE can connect to three CXI01-AB modules with 16 asynchronous
connections each. A cable for connection to the host or other CXI01-AE
concentrators is included. Optional fiber optic connections are available
directly from Digiboard for remote connection up to two kilometers from the
host. Asynchronous connections to the CXI01-AE concentrator are provided
through the RJ45 port; RJ45 to DECMJ11 adapters (CXI01-AF) are also
available.

The CXI01 asynchronous multiplexer products are supported on DEC OSF/1 V3.x,
Windows NT V3.5, and the AlphaServer 2100 and 2000. Up to two CXI01-AA or
CXI01-ADs may be installed in any combination. OpenVMS software is not
supported at this time.

CXI01-AA (Digiboard PC/16em) Configuration

The CXI01-AA includes a host adapter module that connects by a cable
(included) to a small external "PORTS/16em" module that carries connectors
for the asynchronous ports. Up to three optional PORTS modules (total of
four) may be connected to provide 64 asynchronous connections (see
illustration). The basic CXI01-AA is capable of supporting line speeds up to
115 Kbits per second on the first 16 lines, 57.5 Kbits per second with an
additional PORTS module on 32 lines, or 38.4 Kbits per second on a fully
configured 64-line multiplexer.

