BENEFITS:

The CXI01 asynchronous multiplexer products are an alternative to the
terminal server products that are well established in Digital systems. Among
their key benefits are:

o  Windows NT does not support terminal servers; these are the only Digital
   products that enable remote client systems to connect to Microsoft's
   NT/RAS (Remote Access Services) servers with async lines.

o  The price per connection with these async multiplexer products is
   considerably lower than terminal server connections.

o  Terminal servers allow more complex and flexible cabling schemes.
   However, some users resist the perceived additional complexity of having
   both a local area network and terminal servers to support asynchronous
   connections.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The CXI01 asynchronous multiplexer products are available now.

