 DIGITAL AND ISOCOR LINK PC LAN MAIL SYSTEMS TO GLOBAL X.400 MESSAGING
 NETWORKS.....Digital and ISOCOR have announced the capability to link
 leading PC LAN mail systems to industry-standard X.400 enterprise
 messaging networks and the Internet using Digital's MAILbus 400 and
 ISOCOR's series of ISOGATE X.400 gateway products. Users of diverse
 mail systems, including Lotus cc:Mail, Lotus Notes, Microsoft Mail,
 GroupWise, NetWare MHS, or X.400 local and remote user agents, can now
 access and exchange electronic messages over global X.400 networks and
 the Internet via the Simple Mail Transfer Protocol (SMTP), improving
 communications between departments and organizations.

