 NEW VERSION OF POLYCENTER NETWORKER SAVE AND RESTORE ANNOUNCED.....
 Digital and Legato Systems, Inc. have announced new functionality and
 client support for POLYCENTER NetWorker Save and Restore for DEC OSF/1
 Alpha. V3.1 of NetWorker adds clientside archiving, a new graphical
 user interface, concurrent recovery, performance improvements, and new
 clients, including Windows NT for Intel, Windows TCP/IP and a PATHWORKS
 Windows client. Networkers' new archive functionality extends the
 existing NetWorker backup server, allowing users to archive their data,
 annotate the archive set, select archive options, and receive automatic
 notification of archive completion. The new product provides customers
 with powerful tools to protect their data and reduce the time needed to
 manage their data.

 * Fact Sheet - POLYCENTER NetWorker Save & Restore; news0203.txt

